{
  "title": { "zh": "还能找回吗", "en": "Can it be recovered" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "量化器把每个值存成最近的一级。这一关的问题是：量化以后，原来的值还能找回来吗？先让量化器存一张图，同时交出每一格的原值可能落在的范围；再反过来，从几组输入里找出存成同一个结果的那些。",
        "en": "The quantiser stores each value as the nearest level. This level asks: after quantisation, can the original values be recovered? First have the quantiser store an image and give, for each cell, the range its original value may lie in; then go backwards and find, among several inputs, those stored as one same result."
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "1D8",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": { "zh": "存下来", "en": "Store" },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "输入一张图和级数 L：交出量化的结果，以及每一格的原值可能在的范围，从 low 到 high（都在 [0, 1] 里）。",
        "en": "Given an image and a number of levels L, give the quantised result and, for each cell, the range its original may lie in, from low to high (both within [0, 1])."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "相邻两级隔多远？一个值离它存成的那一级，最远能有多远？",
          "en": "How far apart are two neighbouring levels? How far can a value lie from the level it is stored as?"
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "图", "en": "Image" } },
        { "name": "L", "label": { "zh": "级数 L", "en": "Levels L" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "out", "label": { "zh": "量化后", "en": "Quantised" } },
        { "name": "low", "label": { "zh": "原值最低", "en": "Lowest original" } },
        { "name": "high", "label": { "zh": "原值最高", "en": "Highest original" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[0.1, 0.2]], "L": 3 },
          "expect": { "out": [[0, 0]], "low": [[0, 0]], "high": [[0.25, 0.25]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[0.6, 0.7, 0.9]], "L": 3 },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.5, 0.5, 1]], "low": [[0.25, 0.25, 0.75]], "high": [[0.75, 0.75, 1]] }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[0.3, 0.45]], "L": 2 },
          "expect": { "out": [[0, 0]], "low": [[0, 0]], "high": [[0.5, 0.5]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[0.4], [0.95]], "L": 5 },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.5], [1]], "low": [[0.375], [0.875]], "high": [[0.625], [1]] }
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "q = quantise(image, L)",
        "neg = const[value=-1]()",
        "half = const[value=0.5]()",
        "zero = const[value=0]()",
        "one = const[value=1]()",
        "gaps = add(L, neg)",
        "d = div(half, gaps)",
        "nd = mul(d, neg)",
        "lo = add(q, nd)",
        "hi = add(q, d)",
        "loc = max(lo, zero)",
        "hic = min(hi, one)",
        "out <- q",
        "low <- loc",
        "high <- hic"
      ],
      "naive": ["q = quantise(image, L)", "out <- q", "low <- q", "high <- q"]
    },
    {
      "id": "1D8_2",
      "kind": "choice",
      "step": { "zh": "反推", "en": "Backwards" },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "选出量化以后和给出的结果完全相同的全部输入。",
        "en": "Choose every input whose quantised result is exactly the one given."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "把每组输入逐个值算一遍，看它存成哪一级。",
          "en": "Work each input through value by value, and see which level it is stored as."
        }
      ],
      "judge": "answer",
      "rounds": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "存成 3 级以后得到 [0, 0.5] 的输入有哪些？",
                "en": "Which inputs become [0, 0.5] when stored in 3 levels?"
              },
              "answer": ["a", "b", "d"]
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            { "id": "a", "label": "[0.1, 0.6]" },
            { "id": "b", "label": "[0.2, 0.4]" },
            { "id": "c", "label": "[0.3, 0.5]" },
            { "id": "d", "label": "[0.24, 0.74]" },
            { "id": "e", "label": "[0.26, 0.5]" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "存成 2 级以后得到 [0, 1] 的输入有哪些？",
                "en": "Which inputs become [0, 1] when stored in 2 levels?"
              },
              "answer": ["b", "c", "e"]
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            { "id": "a", "label": "[0.5, 0.6]" },
            { "id": "b", "label": "[0.1, 0.9]" },
            { "id": "c", "label": "[0.49, 0.51]" },
            { "id": "d", "label": "[0.6, 0.4]" },
            { "id": "e", "label": "[0.4, 0.5]" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
